{
  "title": "Insurance Journey Health",
  "description": "PoC insurance-business-observability | env:local | ms-propostas -> Outbox -> Kafka -> ms-cadastro. Queries use received series; metrics are best effort, not a financial ledger. Owner scope: this PoC only. https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=project%3Ainsurance-business-observability%20env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29 https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "local"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [
        "ms-propostas",
        "ms-cadastro"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Insurance Business Observability — saúde da jornada**\n\nAt-least-once: retries e duplicatas são tentativas técnicas. Backlog é gauge autoritativa de snapshot; em réplicas do mesmo banco agregue por máximo. Ausência de ponto não significa zero.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Throughput de transições por serviço e etapa",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.business.transitions{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service,step}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Duração média registro e Inbox (ms)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service,step,outcome}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Tentativas de publicação Outbox",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.outbox.publish.attempts{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Duração média de publicação (ms)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:insurance.outbox.publish.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {outcome}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Duplicatas reconhecidas no Inbox",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.inbox.duplicates{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Resultados do Relay (retry aparece quando ocorre)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.outbox.dispatches{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {outcome}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Backlog Outbox atual — máximo entre réplicas",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:insurance.outbox.pending{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Idade do mais antigo pendente (s)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:insurance.outbox.oldest.age{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Disponibilidade do snapshot de backlog (1=leitura válida)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "min:insurance.outbox.snapshot.available{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Falhas técnicas por etapa — No Data sem ocorrências",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:technical_failure} by {step,error_code}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**p95/p99:** histogramas recebidos como distributions, mas is_percentiles_enabled=false na conta. Nenhuma consulta p95/p99 ativa foi criada. Habilitação exige avaliar custo e autorização. Duração por etapa não é latência completa da jornada.\n\n[Logs Explorer](https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=project%3Ainsurance-business-observability%20env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29) | [APM](https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29)\n\nFiltre por business_id nos logs e businessId nos spans. IDs não são tags de métricas.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      }
    }
  ]
}
